"""AS5047U - 14-bit on-axis magnetic rotary position sensor, TSSOP-14, 3.3 V supply mode.

Datasheet: ams AS5047U DS v1-00 (2018-10-30).

Application mode: 3.3 V operation (Figure 11, right). VDD and VDD3V3 are tied to
the 3.0-3.6 V supply (Figure 6, VDD3V3 with VDD = VDD3V3) and decoupled by one
100 nF capacitor. The 5 V mode, with 1 uF on the internal LDO output, is not
supported by this package.

Pins (Figure 4):
- TEST (5) is tied to GND, as required.
- U, V, W/PWM and I/PWM are push-pull outputs, left open (note 5).
- VDD3V3 is typed power_in in the symbol: in 3.3 V mode it is a supply input,
  not the LDO output.
- CSn, CLK and MOSI must not float (note 1). The SPI host drives them; a host
  that can release them must add the pull-up on CSn and pull-downs on CLK and
  MOSI (notes 2 and 3).

Mechanical: the Hall array centre is the package centre, 0.306 mm below the
package top, radius 1.25 mm (Figure 63). Package A2 1.00 mm nominal, A 1.20 mm
max, D 5.00 x E1 4.40 mm, 0.65 mm pitch (Figure 60): JEDEC MO-153 AB-1, which
matches the KiCad TSSOP-14_4.4x5mm_P0.65mm footprint and STEP used here.
"""

load("@stdlib/interfaces.zen", "Spi")

Capacitor = Module("@stdlib/generics/Capacitor.zen")

VDD = io(Power(voltage="3.0V to 3.6V"))
GND = io(Ground)
SPI = io(Spi)
A = io(Net)
B = io(Net)

Component(
    name="AS5047U",
    symbol=Symbol(library="AS5047U.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("TSSOP-14_4.4x5mm_P0.65mm.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="AS5047U-HTSM", manufacturer="ams OSRAM"),
    pins={
        "~{CS}": SPI.CS,
        "CLK": SPI.CLK,
        "MISO": SPI.MISO,
        "MOSI": SPI.MOSI,
        "TEST": GND,
        "B": B,
        "A": A,
        "W/PWM": NotConnected(),
        "V": NotConnected(),
        "U": NotConnected(),
        "VDD": VDD,
        "VDD3V3": VDD,
        "GND": GND,
        "I/PWM": NotConnected(),
    },
)

# Figure 11: one 100 nF on the tied VDD/VDD3V3 node in 3.3 V mode.
Capacitor(
    name="C_VDD",
    value="100nF",
    package="0603",
    voltage="50V",
    dielectric="X7R",
    mpn="CC0603KRX7R9BB104",
    manufacturer="Yageo",
    P1=VDD,
    P2=GND,
)
